        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Vulwani hagati ha Isiraeli na Moabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu muhiga gwa komi na nane gwi liamiiha liu mwami Jehoshafati wi Ivuyuda, Joramu muyaayi wa Ahabu yagwa mwami wa Isiraeli na yamiha mu Samaria, ku mihiga komi na mbiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joramu yakola gaali uvwoni mu zimoni zia Yahova Nyasaye, navuzwa siyaali mudamanu kuli baba na mama weve Jezebeli mba. Yasambula munara gwa Baali, kifananyi cha baba weve yaali na lombi kigira lisigamira lia Baali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Navuzwa, kuli mwami Jeroboamu muyaayi wa Nebati, uwaali imbiri weve, yakola avandu va Isiraeli kokora uvwoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwami Mesha wa Moabu yaali mutugi wa magondi, na vuli muhiga yahaana vusuuru ku mwami wa Isiraeli vwi vimeme via magondi 100,000 kandi vwoya vwa magondi mamigu 100,000. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Navuzwa lwa mwami Ahabu yakuza, mwami Mesha wa Moabu yibaala nukutura ku mwami wa Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nonoho mwami Joramu yatura Samaria kandi navungiza harara amahi geege goosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yatuma amakuva ku mwami Jehoshafati wi Ivuyuda; navoora, “Mwami wa Moabu umali kwibaala ku inzi; ulahambana ninzi kuzia kumulwana?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwami Jehoshafati yativura navoora, “Inzi ndakora ndio. Inzi mbeeye hasi hu vunyali vuvwo harara na avandu vange kandi ni zibarasi ziange kuli zizio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kuziiri kunzira ki lwa kuvingilira?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joramu yativura, “Kulaziira kunzira yi changalangwe cha Edomu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunangwa mwami Joramu na vami vi Ivuyuda na Edomu yaatanga logendo. Inyima wo kogenda ku madiku saba, vadaka amazi, na sihaali ho na gatigala aga vasaza vi liihi kandi agi zinyama ziavagingiraa vindu mba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maku Mwami Joramu wa Isiraeli yavoola, “Kunyi kuudivi! Yahova uviiki kunyi vavaga haasi hi zinguru ziu mwami wa Moabu!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwami Jehoshafati yateeva, “Hakaveeye ho nu muporofeti uwa Yahova wa kunyala koteeva vulaliri vwa Yahova?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maku Munene wa mahi gu mwami Joramu yativura, “Elisha muyaayi wa Shafati aveeye hano. Yaali mulondi wa Elija.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwami Jehoshafati yateeva, “Aveeye muporofeti wa giligali.” Kunangwa avami vavaga yavo vazia ku Elisha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha yavolera mwami wa Isiraeli, “Kigira ki ngokonye? Zia uteeve avaporofeti yavo ava baba na mama woovo vateeva.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Navuzwa Joramu mwami wa Isiraeli yativura, “Awa! Yahova niyie uviiki kunyi avami vavaga hasi hi zinguru ziu mwami wa Moabu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha yativura, “Nzisuha ku lieta lia Yahova oveeye mwoyo, uwa inzi ndumikiraa, ndaavura kuva nu luyali ku mukonyeleri woovo, Jehoshafati, mwami wi Ivuyuda, sindakenyi ngolole mba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lero, ndeteri mundu wu kwimba zinyimbu.” Lwu mwimbi wi zinyimbu yakuba uvukana, zinguru zia Yahova ziaza ku Elisha; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi yavoola, “Yaga nigo ga Yahova avoora, ‘Yavi mitaro ja mazi mu lwaalo lwu mugera mwumu yigu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kali ni muvura kolola imbura kinga imbuza, lwaalo lwu mugera yigu lulizura mazi; na munyi harara ni mitugu jenyu kandi ni zinyama zimulonda zilava na mazi manyingi gu kunwa.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha yaazizagilira, “Navuzwa kindu yiki ne kedoto ku Yahova kokora, alamuha kandi vuguuti ku Vamoabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulaguuta madaala manene malahi gaavo gi zimbinga; mulatema misaala jaavo ja makuyu josi, nu kwigalira vidaho viavo, kandi mwonogonyie milimi migunamu jaavo nu kugifuuma josi na magina.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mugamba gwalonda ku, ku ing'inga yu kuhaana visiuviliru via mugamba kuli kazozo, amazi gaaza nigagenda kutura lovega lwa Edomu nigakunika kivala choosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
