              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vavoola, “Gaveeye amasahi! Mahi gavaga ga vasigu kuduuka gave gaali kulwaana nu kwiitana aveene na vene! Gendi kuzie kulanya hokososa haavo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.23",
