              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwu mwami wa Moabu yamanya ndi azizaa kuguutwa mu vulwani, yavugula vasaza vi vivavi mia saba harara naye kandi nageriza kuvitira mu zimbaso zia vasigu aduuki kwirukira ku mwami wa Siria, navuzwa siyanyariza mba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunangwa yavugula muyaayi weve mukulundu awaali yakavuguyi ovogono vwivwe kuli mwami, namuhaanira ku lidigi lie lidaala linene kuli kisiuviriru ku munyasaye wa Moabu. Vaisiraeli vatihizwa ligali, na ndio vamanya ni virana inyima kutura mu lidaala linene ni virana mu kivala chavo aveene.",
          "type": "text",
